# Solidity: Solidity documentation (0.8.x), Layout of a Source File, Types, Units, Cheatsheet; requirements/languages/solidity.md
name     solidity sol

keyword  pragma contract interface library abstract function modifier event emit error struct enum
keyword  mapping public private internal external view pure payable virtual override returns return
keyword  if else for while do break continue new delete import using is constructor fallback receive
keyword  memory storage calldata immutable constant indexed anonymous unchecked try catch revert
keyword  assembly let
type     address bool string bytes byte int uint int8 int16 int32 int64 int128 int256 uint8 uint16
type     uint32 uint64 uint128 uint256 bytes1 bytes4 bytes8 bytes16 bytes32 fixed ufixed
builtin  true false msg block tx this super require assert keccak256 ether gwei wei seconds minutes
builtin  hours days weeks

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
prefix   unicode hex
escape        : x=2 u4
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~
calls
